er\"><div class=\"tab-circle\"><div class=\"step-number\">2</div></div></div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"process-step-item w-dyn-item\"><div class=\"process-step-header\"><div class=\"tab-circle\"><div class=\"step-number\">3</div></div></div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"process-step-item w-dyn-item\"><div class=\"process-step-header\"><div class=\"tab-circle\"><div class=\"step-number\">4</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"line-bar\"></div></div><div class=\"process-content-wrapper w-dyn-list\"><div role=\"list\" class=\"process-content-list w-dyn-items\"><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"process-content-item w-dyn-item\"><div class=\"process-step\"><div class=\"image-step-tab\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/procesos/pool-screen-enclosure-step-1/pool-screen-enclosures-screen-type-configuration-assessment.avif\" class=\"img-process\" width=\"1450\" height=\"791\"></div><div class=\"content-step-tab\"><div class=\"wrapper-vertical-text\"><h2>Screen Type &amp; Configuration Assessment</h2><div class=\"text-divider\"><div class=\"w-richtext\"><p>Evaluation of standard aluminum screen enclosure vs. hybrid options. Assessment of pool perimeter dimensions, existing deck configuration, and regulatory requirements for screen material and spacing.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"process-content-item w-dyn-item\"><div class=\"process-step\"><div class=\"image-step-tab\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/procesos/pool-screen-enclosure-step-2/pool-screen-enclosures-enclosure-design-material-selection.avif\" class=\"img-process\" width=\"1450\" height=\"791\"></div><div class=\"content-step-tab\"><div class=\"wrapper-vertical-text\"><h2>Enclosure Design &amp; Material Selection</h2><div class=\"text-divider\"><div class=\"w-richtext\"><p>Design of custom enclosure layout with aluminum framing, screen material selection, roof integration (if applicable), and aesthetic coordination with home