t></a></div><div fs-slider-element=\"slide\" role=\"listitem\" class=\"fs-slider-gallery_slide w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"lightbox-link w-inline-block w-lightbox\"><img alt=\"Custom pool screen enclosure with outdoor kitchen and seating installed by licensed Florida pool enclosure builders.\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/images/pool-screen-2/pool-screen-enclosure-builders-florida-02.jpg\" class=\"image-gallery\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\"><script type=\"application/json\" class=\"w-json\">{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"url\": \"/images/images/pool-screen-2/pool-screen-enclosure-builders-florida-02.jpg\",\n      \"type\": \"image\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"group\": \"images\"\n}</script></a></div><div fs-slider-element=\"slide\" role=\"listitem\" class=\"fs-slider-gallery_slide w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"lightbox-link w-inline-block w-lightbox\"><img alt=\"Luxury pool screen enclosure with covered patio built by professional pool enclosure contractors in North and South Florida.\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/images/pool-screen-1/pool-screen-enclosure-builders-florida-01.jpg\" class=\"image-gallery\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\"><script type=\"application/json\" class=\"w-json\">{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"url\": \"/images/images/pool-screen-1/pool-screen-enclosure-builders-florida-01.jpg\",\n      \"type\": \"image\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"group\": \"images\"\n}</script></a></div></div></div><div fs-slider-element=\"scrollbar\" class=\"fs-slider-gallery_scrollbar\"><div fs-slider-element=\"scrollbar-drag\" class=\"fs-slider-gallery_scrollbar_drag\"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"faq-section\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container\"><div data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bc3\" class=\"header-faq\"><h2>Pool Enclosure FAQs</h2><div>Have questions about pool screen enclosure installation in Florida? Our licensed contractors answer the most common questions from Florida homeowners.</div></div><div class=\"wrapper-faq-components\"><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bc7\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Do pool enclosures help protect children and pets?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Yes. A permitted pool screen enclosure meets Florida Building Code Chapter 45 barrier requirements, limiting unsupervised access to the pool area. Rob and Val manage the full permit and inspection process — ensuring your enclosure is structurally sound, code-compliant, and approved by the county before final delivery.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bcf\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">How do pool enclosures reduce maintenance?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Pool screen enclosures block leaves, insects, airborne debris, and direct UV exposure. Homeowners report significantly less time spent skimming and vacuuming, reduced chemical use, and extended pump and filter life — lowering annual maintenance costs and protecting the long-term condition of your pool system.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bd7\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Do pool enclosures allow sunlight and natural airflow?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Yes. Pool screen enclosures are designed to allow abundant natural light and consistent airflow while filtering UV rays and blocking insects. The fine mesh materials reduce direct solar heat gain, keeping the enclosed area more comfortable during Florida's intense summer months without sacrificing visibility or ventilation.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bdf\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Are pool enclosures built to Florida hurricane standards?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Yes. All pool screen enclosures we install use powder-coated aluminum framing and reinforced mesh engineered to meet Florida's wind-load building codes, including HVHZ requirements in South Florida. Each structure is fully permitted and inspected, ensuring compliance with current ASCE 7-22 structural standards.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077be7\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Do pool enclosures increase home value in Florida?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Yes. A professionally designed pool screen enclosure by Mr. and Mrs. Outdoor Living enhances your backyard visual appeal, extends the usable season, and is recognized by real estate professionals as a desirable feature. In Florida competitive housing market, a permitted, structurally sound enclosure adds measurable value to your property.</p></nav></div></div></div><img sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"/images/site/design2-p-500.webp 500w, /images/site/design2-p-800.webp 800w, /images/site/design2-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/site/design2-p-1600.webp 1600w, /images/site/design2.webp 1920w\" alt=\"\" src=\"/images/site/design2.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"design-bg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"146\"></section></div><section class=\"location\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container\"><div data-w-id=\"dfdd7317-58e7-27b3-99a6-2c20a5e8a7be\" class=\"header-location\"><h2>Where We Serve</h2><p>Regional Coverage With National Vision</p></div></div><div class=\"cms-country w-dyn-list\"><div role=\"list\" class=\"cms-list-country w-dyn-items\"><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"item-country w-dyn-item\"><img src=\"/images/where-we-serves/custom-pool-builders-north-florida/service-areas-north-south-florida-pools.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Service areas map showing North Florida coverage for luxury custom pool builders and outdoor living services.\" class=\"full-image-background\" width=\"1250\" height=\"938\"><div data-w-id=\"dfdd7317-58e7-27b3-99a6-2c20a5e8a7c8\" class=\"block-info-country\"><h3 class=\"white\">North Florida</h3><p>L